]]Some superstitions may be[ as]] conscious as having to listen to ‘[Get]] Lucky’ by[ Da]]ft Punk when preparing for an[ event]],[ while]] others may have become embedded in our lifestyle without realizing. For example, you may always complete[ elements]] of a fitness routine in a fixed order or you may always wear a specific piece of clothing.[ Tiger]] Woods always wears a[ red]] shirt when playing final rounds, claiming his mom told him it is his power color. That’s why you should always listen[ to]] your mom.
